config DRM_AGX
	tristate "Apple AGX G16 GPU"
	depends on DRM
	depends on (ARM64 && ARCH_APPLE && ARM64_16K_PAGES) || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on OF && OF_RESERVED_MEM
	help
	  C driver for the GPU of the Apple M4 (T8132, G16G) with the GPU
	  firmware of macOS 27.0.1.

	  So far it validates what the boot loader hands over and identifies
	  the hardware. It does not start the GPU firmware or register a DRM
	  device.

	  If M is selected, the module will be called agx.
